title: Superseded, but still there and sorted above what replaced it.
pid: 771efd8c-90ce-4eeb-8372-6e39483c3fd8
body: |2-
  08:55 ("eight choices are yours") is replaced by 09:00 ("one thing,
  not eight"), which says so, and stands below it. 'Say "build it"'
  repeats a child of 08:40, and is the one title without a date,
  though the note's body says every title starts with one.
